              "short": "$f(4)=6$",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}f(f(f(0)))&=f(f(2))\\\\f(f(f(0)))&=f(4)\\\\f(f(f(0)))&=6\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 18
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p41-q1-b",
